Credits
-------

Map marker coordinates, and the map tiles served through jsDelivr, come from
the witcher3map project by untamed0, under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0:

  https://github.com/witcher3map/witcher3map
  https://github.com/psychodracon/witcher3map  (the fork the tiles are served from)

The credit line rendered on the map in this app is part of satisfying that
attribution requirement. Do not remove it.

Quest ordering and guide data by ChrisRi, with additional detail by xLetalis.

Interface icons are Lucide (https://lucide.dev), ISC licensed.


Not covered by this licence
